('3a1e6993-5510-4e93-9b47-3afe06233eca', 'flower-of-life', 'Fragment of Harmonic Whimsy', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/fragment-of-harmonic-whimsy/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'ATK +18%', 'When the value of a Bond of Life increases or decreases, this character deals 18% increased DMG for 6s. Max 3 stacks.'),
('3acf78d8-1a6b-4bba-942a-f424deb30852', 'sands-of-eon', 'Wanderer\'s Troupe', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/wanderer-s-troupe/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Elemental Mastery +80', 'Increases Charged Attack DMG by 35% if the character uses a Catalyst or Bow.'),
('3ad861ac-3d7e-4297-beb1-671d68a8234b', 'flower-of-life', 'Noblesse Oblige', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/noblesse-oblige/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'Elemental Burst DMG +20%', 'Using an Elemental Burst increase all party members\' ATK by 20% for 12s. This effect cannot stack.'),
('3cf9d0b5-480d-433a-b56d-8f4e9b66dfe3', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Gilded Dreams', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/gilded-dreams/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'Elemental Mastery +80', 'Within 8s of triggering an Elemental Reaction, the character equipping this will obtain buffs based on the Elemental Type of the other party members, ATK is increased by 14% for each party member whose Elemental Type is the same as the equipping character, and Elemental Mastery is increased by 50 for every party member with a different Elemental Type. Each of the aforementioned buffs will count up to 3 characters. This effect can be triggered once every 8s. The character who equips this can still trigger its effects when not on the field.'),
('3ed70e81-23a8-42eb-b686-0443d6f8a2f3', 'flower-of-life', 'Shimenawa\'s Reminiscence', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/shimenawa-s-reminiscence/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'ATK +18%', 'When casting an Elemental Skill, if the character has 15 or more Energy, they lose 15 Energy and Normal/Charged/ Plunging Attack DMG is increased by 50% for 10s. This effect will not trigger again during that duration.'),
('40f8acda-1d85-4a82-a140-1f42f8453148', 'circlet-of-logos', 'Nighttime Whispers in the Echoing Woods', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/nighttime-whispers-in-the-echoing-woods/circlet-of-logos', 1000.0000, 'ATK +18%', 'After using an Elemental Skill, gain a 20% Geo DMG Bonus for 10s. While under a shield granted by the Crystallize reaction, the above effect will be increased by 150%, and this additional increase disappears 1s after that shield is lost.'),
('41bbe900-cf8e-40cd-a19e-9ed0111bef80', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Nymph\'s Dream', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/nymph-s-dream/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'Hydro DMG Bonus +15%', 'After Normal, Charged, and Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills, and Elemental Bursts hit opponents, 1 stack of Mirrored Nymph will be triggered, lasting 8s. When under the effect of 1, 2, or 3, or more Mirrored Nymph stacks, ATK will be increased by 7%/16%/25%, and Hydro DMG will be increased by 4%/9%/15%. Mirrored Nymph stacks created by Normal, Charged, and Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills, and Elemental Bursts exist independently.'),
('48777ffb-6dda-4c33-ae7f-9360a66f19f9', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Ocean-Hued Clam', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/ocean-hued-clam/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'Healing Bonus +15%', 'When the character equipping this artifact set heals a character in the party, a Sea-Dyed Foam will appear for 3 seconds, accumulating the amount of HP recovered from healing (including overflow healing). At the end of the duration, the Sea-Dyed Foam will explode, dealing DMG to nearby opponents based on 90% of the accumulated healing. (This DMG is calculated similarly to Reactions such as Electro-Charged, and Superconduct, but it is not affected by Elemental Mastery, Character Levels, or Reaction DMG Bonuses). Only one Sea-Dyed Foam can be produced every 3.5 seconds. Each Sea-Dyed Foam can accumulate up to 30,000 HP (including overflow healing). There can be no more than one Sea-Dyed Foam active at any given time. This effect can still be triggered even when the character who is using this artifact set is not on the field.'),
('49883091-e99e-43fa-8e33-7da067014f73', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Golden Troupe', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/golden-troupe/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'Increases Elemental Skill DMG by 20%.', 'Increases Elemental Skill DMG by 25%. Additionally, when not on the field, Elemental Skill DMG will be further increased by 25%. This effect will be cleared 2s after taking the field.'),
('499f8dd5-1f38-43d2-ad95-a064254ccea5', 'flower-of-life', 'Flower of Paradise Lost', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/flower-of-paradise-lost/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'Increases Elemental Mastery by 80', 'The equipping character\'s Bloom, Hyperbloom, and Burgeon reaction DMG are increased by 40%. Additionally, after the equipping character triggers Bloom, Hyperbloom, or Burgeon, they will gain another 25% bonus to the effect mentioned prior. Each stack of this lasts 10s. Max 4 stacks simultaneously. This effect can only be triggered once per second. The character who equips this can still trigger its effects when not on the field.'),
('4b877a28-a961-425e-9ce3-4a55ca8652a8', 'flower-of-life', 'Nymph\'s Dream', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/nymph-s-dream/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'Hydro DMG Bonus +15%', 'After Normal, Charged, and Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills, and Elemental Bursts hit opponents, 1 stack of Mirrored Nymph will be triggered, lasting 8s. When under the effect of 1, 2, or 3, or more Mirrored Nymph stacks, ATK will be increased by 7%/16%/25%, and Hydro DMG will be increased by 4%/9%/15%. Mirrored Nymph stacks created by Normal, Charged, and Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills, and Elemental Bursts exist independently.'),
('4c3e26a5-95ff-49c4-82b1-190cf5c4a118', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Echoes of an Offering', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/echoes-of-an-offering/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'ATK +18%', 'When Normal Attacks hit opponents, there is a 36% chance that it will trigger Valley Rite, which will increase Normal Attack DMG by 70% of ATK. \nThis effect will be dispelled 0.05s after a Normal Attack deals DMG. \nIf a Normal Attack fails to trigger Valley Rite, the odds of it triggering the next time will increase by 20%. \nThis trigger can occur once every 0.2s.'),
('4e5f87cb-3879-4f3f-9895-97085e714f34', 'sands-of-eon', 'Defender\'s Will', '4', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/defender-s-will/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Base DEF +30%', 'Increases Elemental RES by 30% for each element present in the party.'),
('4fef3781-aade-46cd-a130-77e863f0f120', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Scholar', '4', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/scholar/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'Energy Recharge +20%.', 'Gaining Energy gives 3 Energy to all party members who have a bow or a catalyst equipped. Can only occurs once every 3s.'),
('5020bcb7-13c3-4d4d-8c80-3419fc3ea4b8', 'plume-of-death', 'Noblesse Oblige', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/noblesse-oblige/plume-of-death', 1000.0000, 'Elemental Burst DMG +20%', 'Using an Elemental Burst increase all party members\' ATK by 20% for 12s. This effect cannot stack.'),
('52abf1f7-f311-49ff-ab38-d33fd1813dfe', 'flower-of-life', 'Gilded Dreams', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/gilded-dreams/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'Elemental Mastery +80', 'Within 8s of triggering an Elemental Reaction, the character equipping this will obtain buffs based on the Elemental Type of the other party members, ATK is increased by 14% for each party member whose Elemental Type is the same as the equipping character, and Elemental Mastery is increased by 50 for every party member with a different Elemental Type. Each of the aforementioned buffs will count up to 3 characters. This effect can be triggered once every 8s. The character who equips this can still trigger its effects when not on the field.'),
('5650f1b3-5e7e-4340-adb0-9c4eb9cad881', 'sands-of-eon', 'Tiny Miracle', '4', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/tiny-miracle/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'All Elemental RES increased by 20%', 'Incoming elemental DMG increases corresponding Elemental RES by 30% for 10s. Can only occur once every 10s.'),
('567cf3f9-9a3e-4b8b-bfce-02a450bbba56', 'circlet-of-logos', 'Marechaussee Hunter', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/marechaussee-hunter/circlet-of-logos', 1000.0000, 'Normal and Charged Attack DMG +15%.', 'When current HP increases or decreases, CRIT Rate will be increased by 12% for 5s. Max 3 stacks.'),
('56cfc099-b156-4cd1-b52f-9be328de025f', 'plume-of-death', 'Fragment of Harmonic Whimsy', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/fragment-of-harmonic-whimsy/plume-of-death', 1000.0000, 'ATK +18%', 'When the value of a Bond of Life increases or decreases, this character deals 18% increased DMG for 6s. Max 3 stacks.'),
('5a776b02-9113-4b8b-aa4c-ba7aeed80e7f', 'sands-of-eon', 'Maiden Beloved', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/maiden-beloved/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Character Healing Effectiveness +15%', 'Using an Elemental Skill or Burst increases healing received by all party members by 20% for 10s.'),
('5b7d5cf9-2505-4829-b543-9f5b52165bb8', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Song of Days Past', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/song-of-days-past/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'Healing Bonus +15%', 'When the equipping character heals a party member, the Yearning effect will be created for 6s, which records the total amount of healing provided (including overflow healing). When the duration expires, the Yearning effect will be transformed into the \"Waves of Days Past\" effect: When your active party member hits an opponent with a Normal Attack, Charged Attack, Plunging Attack, Elemental Skill, or Elemental Burst, the DMG dealt will be increased by 8% of the total healing amount recorded by the Yearning effect. The \"Waves of Days Past\" effect is removed after it has taken effect 5 times or after 10s. A single instance of the Yearning effect can record up to 15,000 healing, and only a single instance can exist at once, but it can record the healing from multiple equipping characters. Equipping characters on standby can still trigger this effect.'),
('5bc77584-a929-4ed5-8b66-e8a8062c716b', 'flower-of-life', 'Pale Flame', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/pale-flame/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'Physical DMG +25%', 'When an Elemental Skill hits an opponent, ATK is increased by 9% for 7s. This effect stacks up to 2 times and can be triggered once every 0.3s. Once 2 stacks are reached the 2 set effect is increased by 100%.'),
('5be8204a-b610-43e6-8c45-dcd835f5a107', 'sands-of-eon', 'Viridescent Venerer', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/viridescent-venerer/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Gain a 15% Anemo DMG Bonus.', 'Increases Swirl DMG by 60%. Decreases opponent\'s Elemental RES to the element infused in the Swirl by 40% for 10s.'),
('5c15fab5-a80c-4f38-9427-77c68c4aa7fc', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Vourukasha\'s Glow', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/vourukasha-s-glow/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'HP +20%', 'Elemental Skill and Elemental Burst DMG will be increased by 10%. After the equipping character takes DMG, the aforementioned DMG bonus is increased by 80% for 5s. This effect increase can have 5 stacks. The duration of each stack is counted independently. These effects can be triggered even when the equipping character is not on the field.'),
