('60075812-6473-4b5d-9357-e26f1a5f32ec', 'sands-of-eon', 'Thundering Fury', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/thundering-fury/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Gain a 15% Electro DMG Bonus.', 'Increases damage caused by Overloaded, Electro-Charged, and Superconduct DMG by 40%. Triggering such effects decreases Elemental Skill CD by 1s. Can only occur once every 0.8s.'),
