('98aec787-42ff-4619-912a-2d2793ab3d9d', 'sands-of-eon', 'Scholar', '4', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/scholar/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Energy Recharge +20%.', 'Gaining Energy gives 3 Energy to all party members who have a bow or a catalyst equipped. Can only occurs once every 3s.'),
