('9e8e0765-c2e2-4751-a282-72ff9a509cbb', 'circlet-of-logos', 'Gladiator\'s Finale', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/gladiator-s-finale/circlet-of-logos', 1000.0000, 'ATK +18%', 'If the wielder of this artifact set uses a Sword, Claymore or Polearm, increases their Normal Attack DMG by 35%.'),
