('f0da44d1-f5a1-45b2-a7a5-2198a732c175', 'plume-of-death', 'Traveling Doctor', '3', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/traveling-doctor/plume-of-death', 1000.0000, 'Increases incoming healing by 20%.', 'Using Elemental Burst restores 20% HP.'),
('f30a42af-1e25-48b3-9c80-49e775a0c292', 'circlet-of-logos', 'Maiden Beloved', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/maiden-beloved/circlet-of-logos', 1000.0000, 'Character Healing Effectiveness +15%', 'Using an Elemental Skill or Burst increases healing received by all party members by 20% for 10s.'),
('f3da6685-09ff-48a2-b38b-eb4d1a9a471a', 'flower-of-life', 'Ocean-Hued Clam', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/ocean-hued-clam/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'Healing Bonus +15%', 'When the character equipping this artifact set heals a character in the party, a Sea-Dyed Foam will appear for 3 seconds, accumulating the amount of HP recovered from healing (including overflow healing). At the end of the duration, the Sea-Dyed Foam will explode, dealing DMG to nearby opponents based on 90% of the accumulated healing. (This DMG is calculated similarly to Reactions such as Electro-Charged, and Superconduct, but it is not affected by Elemental Mastery, Character Levels, or Reaction DMG Bonuses). Only one Sea-Dyed Foam can be produced every 3.5 seconds. Each Sea-Dyed Foam can accumulate up to 30,000 HP (including overflow healing). There can be no more than one Sea-Dyed Foam active at any given time. This effect can still be triggered even when the character who is using this artifact set is not on the field.'),
('f4d88d6a-73dc-468e-bf19-9b55a9c6eb58', 'plume-of-death', 'Song of Days Past', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/song-of-days-past/plume-of-death', 1000.0000, 'Healing Bonus +15%', 'When the equipping character heals a party member, the Yearning effect will be created for 6s, which records the total amount of healing provided (including overflow healing). When the duration expires, the Yearning effect will be transformed into the \"Waves of Days Past\" effect: When your active party member hits an opponent with a Normal Attack, Charged Attack, Plunging Attack, Elemental Skill, or Elemental Burst, the DMG dealt will be increased by 8% of the total healing amount recorded by the Yearning effect. The \"Waves of Days Past\" effect is removed after it has taken effect 5 times or after 10s. A single instance of the Yearning effect can record up to 15,000 healing, and only a single instance can exist at once, but it can record the healing from multiple equipping characters. Equipping characters on standby can still trigger this effect.'),
('f51ed330-a82b-42e8-accd-04d95f1dd1a4', 'flower-of-life', 'Heart of Depth', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/heart-of-depth/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'Hydro DMG Bonus +15%', 'After using Elemental Skill, increases Normal Attack and Charged Attack DMG by 30% for 15s.'),
('fa4f781c-2c04-481c-beca-33d4c37b5568', 'circlet-of-logos', 'Shimenawa\'s Reminiscence', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/shimenawa-s-reminiscence/circlet-of-logos', 1000.0000, 'ATK +18%', 'When casting an Elemental Skill, if the character has 15 or more Energy, they lose 15 Energy and Normal/Charged/ Plunging Attack DMG is increased by 50% for 10s. This effect will not trigger again during that duration.'),
('fb115cdf-dadb-4be3-aa87-35e4bb4519a1', 'sands-of-eon', 'Flower of Paradise Lost', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/flower-of-paradise-lost/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Increases Elemental Mastery by 80', 'The equipping character\'s Bloom, Hyperbloom, and Burgeon reaction DMG are increased by 40%. Additionally, after the equipping character triggers Bloom, Hyperbloom, or Burgeon, they will gain another 25% bonus to the effect mentioned prior. Each stack of this lasts 10s. Max 4 stacks simultaneously. This effect can only be triggered once per second. The character who equips this can still trigger its effects when not on the field.'),
('fb56925b-012e-4db4-8a5a-1c4dc3a3ef2f', 'sands-of-eon', 'Noblesse Oblige', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/noblesse-oblige/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Elemental Burst DMG +20%', 'Using an Elemental Burst increase all party members\' ATK by 20% for 12s. This effect cannot stack.'),
('fc2afdd2-75c3-44bb-b8b2-7a8bdc062dc3', 'circlet-of-logos', 'The Exile', '4', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/the-exile/circlet-of-logos', 1000.0000, 'Energy Recharge +20%', 'Using an Elemental Burst regenerates 2 Energy for other party members every 2s for 6s. This effect cannot stack.'),
('fd5d4581-6a32-4ef0-a0ab-c8026aa4232c', 'sands-of-eon', 'Bloodstained Chivalry', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/bloodstained-chivalry/sands-of-eon', 1000.0000, 'Physical DMG +25%', 'After defeating an opponent, increases Charged Attack DMG by 50%, and reduces its Stamina cost to 0 for 10s.'),
('fe822a08-458f-4411-a350-c87ba2a76984', 'goblet-of-eonothem', 'Noblesse Oblige', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/noblesse-oblige/goblet-of-eonothem', 1000.0000, 'Elemental Burst DMG +20%', 'Using an Elemental Burst increase all party members\' ATK by 20% for 12s. This effect cannot stack.'),
('fed959ac-cf22-4442-b618-9020f4d577b2', 'flower-of-life', 'Maiden Beloved', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/maiden-beloved/flower-of-life', 1000.0000, 'Character Healing Effectiveness +15%', 'Using an Elemental Skill or Burst increases healing received by all party members by 20% for 10s.'),
('ffea1ce8-eb7e-4ce3-86ab-98cc8ae11097', 'circlet-of-logos', 'Nymph\'s Dream', '5', 1000, 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/artifacts/nymph-s-dream/circlet-of-logos', 1000.0000, 'Hydro DMG Bonus +15%', 'After Normal, Charged, and Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills, and Elemental Bursts hit opponents, 1 stack of Mirrored Nymph will be triggered, lasting 8s. When under the effect of 1, 2, or 3, or more Mirrored Nymph stacks, ATK will be increased by 7%/16%/25%, and Hydro DMG will be increased by 4%/9%/15%. Mirrored Nymph stacks created by Normal, Charged, and Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills, and Elemental Bursts exist independently.');
INSERT INTO `user` (`userID`, `username`, `email`, `password`, `provider`, `money`, `roles`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
('c8a54cd8-a9ed-4b5b-8dd4-471d9cf1bd13', 'Ayam Jago', 'ayamjago@gmail.com', '$2b$07$vzKn9xOyUAgYenr.GpGA1O7pMYSVXmMV/aesBjjW9hVbJpHHV1OJS', 'local', 100000.0000, 'admin', '2026-06-05 11:51:22', '2026-06-05 11:51:22'),
('f9aeb268-04cc-4aad-8e16-2d5ab77b365e', 'Maltzu', 'maltzu@gmail.com', '$2b$07$sfq7zUJkQS2tSMtrZwq3MOXoha/S14fmv6SUuBctcSMhJeBXUDmU.', 'local', 10000.0000, 'user', '2026-06-05 11:51:22', '2026-06-05 11:51:22');
INSERT INTO `weapon` (`weaponID`, `name`, `type`, `rarity`, `baseAttack`, `subStat`, `passiveName`, `passiveDesc`, `image_url`, `price`, `stock`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
('00bdafdb-9d75-4723-8a34-ab0a6440aa53', 'The Flute', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Chord', 'Normal or Charged Attacks grant Harmonic on hits. Gaining 5 Harmonics triggers the power of music and deals 100/125/150/175/200% ATK DMG to surrounding enemies. Harmonics last up to 30s, and a maximum of 1 can be gained every 0.5s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-flute/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:48', '2026-06-05 11:50:48'),
('02407739-d637-473b-a9e5-d50d4a762083', 'Prototype Amber', 'Catalyst', '4', '42', 'HP', 'Gilding', 'Using an Elemental Burst regenerates 4 Energy every 2s for 6s. All party members will regenerate 4% HP every 2s for this duration.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/prototype-amber/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:34', '2026-06-05 11:50:34'),
('05e79808-e297-4d2e-b9ba-d46419207607', 'Slingshot', 'Bow', '3', '38', 'CRIT Rate', 'Slingshot', 'If a Normal Attack or Aimed Shot hits a target within 0.3s of being fired, increases DMG by 36/42/48/54/60%; otherwise, it decreases DMG by 10%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/slingshot/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:44', '2026-06-05 11:50:44'),
('07e3b2b1-0ee0-4176-be9d-a3961f6baf7b', 'Makhaira Aquamarine', 'Claymore', '4', '42', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Desert Pavilion', 'The following effect will trigger every 10s: The equipping character will gain 24% of their Elemental Mastery as bonus ATK for 12s, with nearby party members gaining 30% of this buff for the same duration. Multiple instances of this weapon can allow this buff to stack. This effect will still trigger even if the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/makhaira-aquamarine/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:29', '2026-06-05 11:50:29'),
('08a3ff1f-ddeb-4336-816d-0fce973d6c00', 'Tidal Shadow', 'Claymore', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'White Cruising Wave', 'After the wielder is healed, ATK will be increased by 24% for 8s. This can be triggered even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/tidal-shadow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:50', '2026-06-05 11:50:50'),
('0a12d10c-32a4-4eab-906c-cc33abee8a36', 'Polar Star', 'Bow', '5', '46', 'CRIT Rate', 'Daylight\'s Augury', 'Elemental Skill and Elemental Burst DMG increased by 12/15/18/21/24%. After a Normal Attack, Charged Attack, Elemental Skill or Elemental Burst hits an opponent, 1 stack of Ashen Nightstar will be gained for 12s. When 1/2/3/4 stacks of Ashen Nightstar are present, ATK is increased by (10/12.5/15/17.5/20)/(20/25/30/35/40)/(30/37.5/45/52.5/60)/(48/60/72/84/96)%. The stack of Ashen Nightstar created by the Normal Attack, Charged Attack, Elemental Skill or Elemental Burst will be counted independently of the others.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/polar-star/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:32', '2026-06-05 11:50:32'),
('0a6d9dca-a26a-4e14-8684-df2fd1aa3f2d', 'Sacrificial Fragments', 'Catalyst', '4', '41', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Composed', 'After damaging an opponent with an Elemental Skill, the skill has a 40/50/60/70/80% chance to end its own CD. Can only occur once every 30/26/22/18/14s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/sacrificial-fragments/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:40', '2026-06-05 11:50:40'),
('0a773dc6-a88b-432b-a8c8-8d1ccb9dca2d', 'White Iron Greatsword', 'Claymore', '3', '39', 'DEF', 'Cull the Weak', 'Defeating an opponent restores 8/10/12/14/16% HP.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/white-iron-greatsword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:54', '2026-06-05 11:50:54'),
('0e78fb37-559f-4210-84ad-d7de8682f1c4', 'Skyward Blade', 'Sword', '5', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Sky-Piercing Fang', 'CRIT Rate increased by 4%. Gains Skypiercing Might upon using an Elemental Burst:\nIncreases Movement SPD by 10%, increases ATK SPD by 10%, and increases the DMG of Normal and Charged Attack hits by 20% for 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/skyward-blade/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:43', '2026-06-05 11:50:43'),
('0f8c5997-d7df-4554-a10e-a3fda984de4f', 'Sacrificial Bow', 'Bow', '4', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Composed', 'After damaging an opponent with an Elemental Skill, the skill has a 40/50/60/70/80% chance to end its own CD. Can only occur once every 30/26/22/18/14s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/sacrificial-bow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:39', '2026-06-05 11:50:39'),
('11320fb6-4772-48ac-9809-b4692d165e5c', 'Ibis Piercer', 'Bow', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'Secret Wisdom\'s Favor', 'The character\'s Elemental Mastery will increase by 40/50/60/70/80 within 6s after Charged Attacks hit opponents. Max 2 stacks. This effect can triggered once every 0.5s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/ibis-piercer/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:24', '2026-06-05 11:50:24'),
('118a8355-3a41-465a-9c47-3a72b111e8c4', 'The Stringless', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Arrowless Song', 'Increases Elemental Skill and Elemental Burst DMG by 24/30/36/42/48%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-stringless/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:49', '2026-06-05 11:50:49'),
('11f7d0d4-ce60-44d2-bad9-d30e2c79c9af', 'End of the Line', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'Energy Recharge', 'Net Snapper', 'Triggers the Flowrider effect after using an Elemental Skill, dealing 80% ATK as AoE DMG upon hitting an opponent with an attack. Flowrider will be removed after 15s or after causing 3 instances of AoE DMG. Only 1 instance of AoE DMG can be caused every 2s in this way. Flowrider can be triggered once every 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/end-of-the-line/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:17', '2026-06-05 11:50:17'),
('123ebbfa-ed1d-4480-b0a2-d26150016ceb', 'Prototype Rancour', 'Sword', '4', '44', 'Physical DMG Bonus', 'Smashed Stone', 'On hit, Normal or Charged Attacks increase Base ATK and DEF by 4/4.5/5/5.5/6% for 6s. Max 4 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.3s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/prototype-rancour/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:35', '2026-06-05 11:50:35'),
('128847c0-13b4-45c4-b685-8035992e4e96', 'Traveler\'s Handy Sword', 'Sword', '3', '40', 'DEF', 'Journey', 'Each Elemental Orb or Particle collected restores 1/1.25/1.5/1.75/2% HP.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/traveler-s-handy-sword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:51', '2026-06-05 11:50:51'),
('13657a88-6aa1-44f0-ac0f-4b63745c837a', 'Amenoma Kageuchi', 'Sword', '4', '41', 'ATK', 'Iwakura Succession', 'After casting an Elemental Skill, gain 1 Succession Seed. This effect can be triggered once every 5s. The Succession Seed lasts for 30s. Up to 3 Succession Seeds may exist simultaneously. After using an Elemental Burst, all Succession Seeds are consumed and after 2s, the character regenerates 6/7.5/9/10.5/12 Energy for each seed consumed.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/amenoma-kageuchi/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:08', '2026-06-05 11:50:08'),
('13b6d89c-cb7e-457d-b7ea-ced96ec28b2e', 'Summit Shaper', 'Sword', '5', '46', 'ATK', 'No Passive', 'Increases Shield Strength by 20/25/30/35/40%. Scoring hits on opponents increases ATK by 4/5/6/7/8% for 8s. Max 5 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.3s. While protected by a shield, this ATK increase effect is increased by 100%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/summit-shaper/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:46', '2026-06-05 11:50:46'),
('187c01b7-df1f-459a-b21b-2c77c8ab9e95', 'Dodoco Tales', 'Catalyst', '4', '41', 'ATK', 'Dodoventure!', 'Normal Attack hits on opponents increase Charged Attack DMG by 16/20/24/28/32% for 6s. Charged Attack hits on opponents increase ATK by 8/10/12/14/16% for 6s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/dodoco-tales/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:15', '2026-06-05 11:50:15'),
('19cc4521-d5cd-4d1c-a0f8-f3b6f91d917f', 'Everlasting Moonglow', 'Catalyst', '5', '46', 'HP', 'Byakuya Kougetsu', 'Healing Bonus increased by 10/12.5/15/17.5/20%, Normal Attack DMG is increased by 1/1.5/2/2.5/3% of the Max HP of the character equipping this weapon. For 12s after using an Elemental Burst, Normal Attacks that hit opponents will restore 0.6 Energy. Energy can be restored this way once every 0.1s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/everlasting-moonglow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:18', '2026-06-05 11:50:18'),
('1fbff97e-895c-43b3-a272-39ec6c87c6a7', 'Sapwood Blade', 'Sword', '4', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Forest Sanctuary', 'After triggering Burning, Quicken, Aggravate, Spread, Bloom, Hyperbloom, or Burgeon, a Leaf of Consciousness will be created around the character for a maximum of 10s. When picked up, the Leaf will grant the character 60 Elemental Mastery for 12s. Only 1 Leaf can be generated this way every 20s. This effect can still be triggered if the character is not on the field. The Leaf of Consciousness\' effect cannot stack.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/sapwood-blade/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:41', '2026-06-05 11:50:41'),
('23e717b7-d087-45e5-a20b-9b4c228ef2e4', 'Blackcliff Longsword', 'Sword', '4', '44', 'CRIT DMG', 'Press the Advantage', 'After defeating an enemy, ATK is increased by 12/15/18/21/24% for 30s. This effect has a maximum of 3 stacks, and the duration of each stack is independent of the others.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/blackcliff-longsword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:11', '2026-06-05 11:50:11'),
('2664a44d-758b-4750-8c6f-f2fbbb705754', 'Amber Catalyst', 'Catalyst', '3', '40', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Normal Attack hits increase all Elemental DMG by 6/7.5/9/10.5/12% for 6s. Max 2 stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/amber-catalyst/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:08', '2026-06-05 11:50:08'),
('27eb8f6b-795b-4729-b3c2-5e3695b8e9ba', 'Dark Iron Sword', 'Sword', '3', '40', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Overloaded', 'Upon causing an Overloaded, Superconduct, Electro-Charged, or an Electro-infused Swirl reaction, increases Base ATK by 20/25/30/35/40% for 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/dark-iron-sword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:14', '2026-06-05 11:50:14'),
('280f54c4-8213-4aba-9a1b-651aef94ac4f', 'Splendor of Tranquil Waters', 'Sword', '5', '44', 'CRIT DMG', 'Dawn and Dusk by the Lake', 'When the equipping character\'s current HP increases or decreases, Elemental Skill DMG dealt will be increased by 8/10/12/14/16% for 6s. Max 3 stacks. This effect can be triggered once every 0.2s. When other party members\' current HP increases or decreases, the equipping character\'s Max HP will be increased by 14/17.5/21/24.5/28% for 6s. Max 2 stacks. This effect can be triggered once every 0.2s. The aforementioned effects can be triggered even if the wielder is off-field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/splendor-of-tranquil-waters/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:45', '2026-06-05 11:50:45'),
('281502ba-295a-4629-8510-d42095aa0a5c', 'Debate Club', 'Claymore', '3', '39', 'ATK', 'Blunt Conclusion', 'After using an Elemental Skill, Normal or Charged Attacks, on hit, deal an additional 60/75/90/105/120% ATK DMG in a small area. Effect lasts 15s. DMG can only occur once every 3s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/debate-club/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:15', '2026-06-05 11:50:15'),
('28c27058-2c80-48df-9bd0-7e590cf28501', 'Dialogues of the Desert Sages', 'Polearm', '4', '42', 'HP', 'Principle of Equilibrium', 'When the wielder performs healing, restore 8 Energy. This effect can be triggered once every 10s and can occur even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/dialogues-of-the-desert-sages/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:15', '2026-06-05 11:50:15'),
('2af64a7d-293f-4227-af1d-0e0b9e3f33c7', 'Seasoned Hunter\'s Bow', 'Bow', '2', '33', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/seasoned-hunter-s-bow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:41', '2026-06-05 11:50:41'),
('2c0f45e3-f002-482f-95ff-2c6d8c2f321c', 'Katsuragikiri Nagamasa', 'Claymore', '4', '42', 'Energy Recharge', 'Samurai Conduct', 'Increases Elemental Skill DMG by 6/7.5/9/10.5/12%. After Elemental Skill hits an opponent, the character loses 3 Energy but regenerates 3/3.5/4/4.5/5 Energy every 2s for the next 6s. This effect can occur once every 10s. Can be triggered even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/katsuragikiri-nagamasa/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:26', '2026-06-05 11:50:26'),
('2c27c6db-3aad-4823-9049-39025727dfb8', 'Sword of Narzissenkreuz', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Holy Sword', 'In countless stories, the weapon that befits the legendary hero is also the key to opening all gates, required to surpass the climax and reach destiny\'s denouement.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/sword-of-narzissenkreuz/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:46', '2026-06-05 11:50:46'),
('2cafed3e-b87a-4802-9861-83a5f756f50d', 'Favonius Lance', 'Polearm', '4', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Windfall', 'CRIT hits have a 60/70/80/90/100% chance to generate 1 Elemental Orb, which will regenerate 6 Energy for the character. Can only occur once every 12/10.5/9/7.5/6s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/favonius-lance/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:19', '2026-06-05 11:50:19'),
('2e820e4a-7c32-43d5-8385-8c78ac5f6649', 'Festering Desire', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'Energy Recharge', 'No Passive', 'Increases Elemental Skill DMG by 16/20/24/28/32% and Elemental Skill CRIT Rate by 6/7.5/9/10.5/12%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/festering-desire/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:20', '2026-06-05 11:50:20'),
('2ee5ed76-5231-4dc6-acad-7a743505f4bc', 'Kagura\'s Verity', 'Catalyst', '5', '46', 'CRIT DMG', 'Kagura Dance of the Sacred Sakura', 'Gains the Kagura Dance effect when using an Elemental Skill, causing the Elemental Skill DMG of the character wielding this weapon to increase by 12/15/18/21/24% for 16s. Max 3 stacks. This character will gain 12/15/18/21/24% All Elemental DMG Bonus when they possess 3 stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/kagura-s-verity/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:25', '2026-06-05 11:50:25'),
('2f45a020-505d-4e07-b942-189c46a7587c', 'Rainslasher', 'Claymore', '4', '42', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Bane of Storm and Tide', 'Increases DMG against enemies affected by Hydro or Electro by 20/25/30/35/40%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/rainslasher/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:36', '2026-06-05 11:50:36'),
('30790ba1-12cd-4f5c-887a-0eb22c3504c9', 'Halberd', 'Polearm', '3', '40', 'ATK', 'Heavy', 'Normal Attacks deal an additional 160/200/240/280/320% DMG. Can only occur once every 10s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/halberd/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:23', '2026-06-05 11:50:23'),
('33984969-9273-48de-9bf4-8539e0061706', 'Xiphos\' Moonlight', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Jinni\'s Whisper', 'The following effect will trigger every 10s: The equipping character will gain 0.036% Energy Recharge for each point of Elemental Mastery they possess for 12s, with nearby party members gaining 30% of this buff for the same duration. Multiple instances of this weapon can allow this buff to stack. This effect will still trigger even if the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/xiphos-moonlight/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:56', '2026-06-05 11:50:56'),
('340efd2a-b3bf-4058-9479-afad2853f2af', 'Crimson Moon\'s Semblance', 'Polearm', '5', '48', 'CRIT Rate', 'Ashen Sun\'s Shadow', 'Grants a Bond of Life equal to 25% of Max HP when a Charged Attack hits an opponent. This effect can be triggered up to once every 14s. In addition, when the equipping character has a Bond of Life, they gain a 12/16/20/24/28% DMG Bonus; if the value of the Bond of Life is greater than or equal to 30% of Max HP, then gain an additional 24/32/40/48/56% DMG', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/crimson-moon-s-semblance/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:14', '2026-06-05 11:50:14'),
('39087061-79a2-4159-a75a-814a033383a5', 'Compound Bow', 'Bow', '4', '41', 'Physical DMG Bonus', 'Infusion Arrow', 'Normal Attack and Aimed Shot hits increase ATK by 4/5/6/7/8% and Normal Attack SPD by 1.2/1.5/1.8/2.1/2.4% for 6s. Max 4 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.3s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/compound-bow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:13', '2026-06-05 11:50:13'),
('39d4c754-c012-49a6-aec2-6c9902940d5b', 'Dull Blade', 'Sword', '1', '23', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/dull-blade/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:16', '2026-06-05 11:50:16'),
('3ab450e1-eb5c-49a1-b9fb-5969067b6ad9', 'Portable Power Saw', 'Claymore', '4', '41', 'HP', 'Sea Shanty', 'When the wielder is healed or heals others, they will gain a Stoic\'s Symbol that lasts 30s, up to a maximum of 3 Symbols. When using their Elemental Skill or Burst, all Symbols will be consumed and the Roused effect will be granted for 10s. For each Symbol consumed, gain 40/50/60/70/80 Elemental Mastery, and 2s after the effect occurs, 2/2.5/3/3.5/4 Energy per Symbol consumed will be restored for said character. The Roused effect can be triggered once every 15s, and Symbols can be gained even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/portable-power-saw/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:33', '2026-06-05 11:50:33'),
('3baf9b27-7fdd-4187-a003-9c1386afa1a8', 'Blackcliff Agate', 'Catalyst', '4', '42', 'CRIT DMG', 'Press the Advantage', 'After defeating an opponent, ATK is increased by 12% for 30s. This effect has a maximum of 3 stacks, and the duration of each stack is independent of the others.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/blackcliff-agate/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:11', '2026-06-05 11:50:11'),
('3cc6d84a-fc70-47ce-be41-93be3d7cac8d', 'Range Gauge', 'Bow', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'Masons\' Ditty', 'When the wielder is healed or heals others, they will gain a Unity\'s Symbol that lasts 30s, up to a maximum of 3 Symbols. When using their Elemental Skill or Burst, all Symbols will be consumed and the Struggle effect will be granted for 10s. For each Symbol consumed, gain 3/4/5/6/7% ATK and 7/8.5/10/11.5/% All Elemental DMG Bonus. The Struggle effect can be triggered once every 15s, and Symbols can be gained even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/range-gauge/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:36', '2026-06-05 11:50:36'),
('3e866e77-2a64-4e3c-8237-de510898227e', 'Mouun\'s Moon', 'Bow', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'Watatsumi Wavewalker', 'For every point of the entire party\'s combined maximum Energy capacity, the Elemental Burst DMG of the character equipping this weapon is increased by 0.12/0.15/0.18/0.21/0.24%. A maximum of 40/50/60/70/80% increased Elemental Burst DMG can be achieved this way.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/mouun-s-moon/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:31', '2026-06-05 11:50:31'),
('3f04c5be-4da0-4c1e-ae7e-d7737a86aacc', 'Forest Regalia', 'Claymore', '4', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Forest Sanctuary', 'After triggering Burning, Quicken, Aggravate, Spread, Bloom, Hyperbloom, or Burgeon, a Leaf of Consciousness will be created around the character for a maximum of 10s. When picked up, the Leaf will grant the character 60 Elemental Mastery for 12s. Only 1 Leaf can be generated this way every 20s. This effect can still be triggered if the character is not on the field. The Leaf of Consciousness\' effect cannot stack.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/forest-regalia/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:21', '2026-06-05 11:50:21'),
('3f130623-e3a0-41b1-b575-797446519595', 'Toukabou Shigure', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Kaidan: Rainfall Earthbinder', 'After an attack hits opponents, it will inflict an instance of Cursed Parasol upon one of them for 10s. This effect can be triggered once every 15s. If this opponent is defeated during Cursed Parasol\'s duration, Cursed Parasol\'s CD will be refreshed immediately. The character wielding this weapon will deal 16/20/24/28/32% more DMG to the opponent affected by Cursed Parasol.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/toukabou-shigure/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:51', '2026-06-05 11:50:51'),
('3fa57af8-738b-41be-8e0b-95a740b3cb6c', 'Favonius Sword', 'Sword', '4', '41', 'Energy Recharge', 'Windfall', 'CRIT hits have a 60/70/80/90/100% chance to generate 1 Elemental Orb, which will regenerate 6 Energy for the character. Can only occur once every 12/10.5/9/7.5/6s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/favonius-sword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:19', '2026-06-05 11:50:19'),
('40c1d78e-b90c-4f1e-b62a-b37087a8ac69', 'Pocket Grimoire', 'Catalyst', '2', '33', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/pocket-grimoire/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:32', '2026-06-05 11:50:32'),
('40d4fb53-3b99-4040-b8f1-a6e10f2fa532', 'Redhorn Stonethresher', 'Claymore', '5', '44', 'CRIT DMG', 'Gokadaiou Otogibanashi', 'DEF is increased by 28/35/42/49/56%. Normal and Charged Attack DMG is increased by 40/50/60/70/80% of DEF.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/redhorn-stonethresher/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:37', '2026-06-05 11:50:37'),
('42dcee43-ba2a-4b73-bca9-5d14ee793433', 'Predator', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Strong Strike', 'This weapon\'s effect is only applied on the following platform(s):\'PlayStation Network\' Dealing Cryo DMG to opponents increases this character\'s Normal and Charged Attack DMG by 10% for 6s. This effect can have a maximum of 2 stacks. Additionally, when Aloy equips Predator, ATK is increased by 66.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/predator/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:33', '2026-06-05 11:50:33'),
('4633ebf2-2302-48d3-acab-06bcf500b2f4', 'Mailed Flower', 'Claymore', '4', '44', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Whispers of Wind and Flower', 'Within 8s after the character\'s Elemental Skill hits an opponent or the character triggers an Elemental Reaction, their ATK and Elemental Mastery will be increased by 12% and 48 respectively.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/mailed-flower/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:29', '2026-06-05 11:50:29'),
('4ab6affa-ee79-469f-934f-458cdc6264a4', 'Prototype Crescent', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Unreturning', 'Aimed Shot hits on weak points increase Movement SPD by 10% and ATK by 6% for 10s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/prototype-crescent/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:35', '2026-06-05 11:50:35'),
('4d52259d-5a58-41c9-a79a-ac8e7f301555', 'Aquila Favonia', 'Sword', '5', '48', 'Physical DMG Bonus', 'Falcon\'s Defiance', 'ATK is increased by 20/25/30/35/40%. Triggers on taking DMG: the soul of the Falcon of the West awakens, holding the banner of the resistance aloft, regenerating HP equal to 100/115/130/145/160% of ATK and dealing 200/230/260/290/320% of ATK as DMG to surrounding enemies. This effect can only occur once every 15s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/aquila-favonia/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:09', '2026-06-05 11:50:09'),
('4d7bd78a-a55c-4efb-bfdf-fe66d869b209', 'Alley Hunter', 'Bow', '4', '41', 'Attack', 'Urban Guerrilla', 'Every 4s a character is on the field, their ATK increases by 4/5/6/7/8% and their CRIT DMG increases by 4/5/6/7/8%. This effect has a maximum of 5 stacks and will not be reset if the character leaves the field, but will be cleared when the character takes DMG.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/alley-hunter/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:08', '2026-06-05 11:50:08'),
('4dfa05d2-b825-4b4e-bb59-0123db66fdab', 'Cool Steel', 'Sword', '3', '39', 'ATK', 'Bane of Water and Ice', 'Increases DMG against enemies affected by Hydro or Cryo by 12/15/18/21/24%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/cool-steel/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:13', '2026-06-05 11:50:13'),
('4f623b30-d7b3-43f6-8ca9-f879a2683bd8', 'Deathmatch', 'Polearm', '4', '41', 'CRIT Rate', 'Gladiator', 'If there are at least 2 opponents nearby, ATK is increased by 16% and DEF is increased by 16%. If there are less than 2 enemies nearby, ATK is increased by 24%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/deathmatch/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:15', '2026-06-05 11:50:15'),
('5131301a-4c50-409b-b558-3b809e46cdad', 'Prototype Starglitter', 'Polearm', '4', '42', 'Energy Recharge', 'Magic Affinity', 'After using an Elemental Skill, increases Normal and Charged Attack DMG by 8% for 12s. Max 2 stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/prototype-grudge/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:35', '2026-06-05 11:50:35'),
('5151d913-0915-4ecc-9a25-cb2f95e04427', 'The Alley Flash', 'Sword', '4', '44', 'CRIT Rate', 'Itinerant Hero', 'Continuosly sprinting for at least 1s increases ATK by 28% for 6s. This effect cannot stack.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-alley-flash/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:47', '2026-06-05 11:50:47'),
('525934f5-2a23-4ae3-8fe3-71fb65471bed', 'Flowing Purity', 'Catalyst', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'Unfinished Masterpiece', 'When using an Elemental Skill, All Elemental DMG Bonus will be increased by 8% for 15s, and a Bond of Life worth 24% of Max HP will be granted. This effect can be triggered once every 10s. When the Bond of Life is cleared, every 1,000 HP cleared in the process will provide 2% All Elemental DMG Bonus. Up to a maximum of 12% All Elemental DMG can be gained this way. This effect lasts 15s. Bond of Life: Absorbs healing for the character based on its base value, and clears after healing equal to this value is obtained.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/flowing-purity/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:21', '2026-06-05 11:50:21'),
('530edbea-87f2-4408-a93d-176f753fbf01', 'Kitain Cross Spear', 'Polearm', '4', '44', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Samurai Conduct', 'Increases Elemental Skill DMG by 6/7.5/9/10.5/12%. After Elemental Skill hits an opponent, the character loses 3 Energy but regenerates 3/3.5/4/4.5/5 Energy every 2s for the next 6s. This effect can occur once every 10s. Can be triggered even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/kitain-cross-spear/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:27', '2026-06-05 11:50:27'),
('53b0f240-9aa2-416d-8e35-39848cbaec2f', 'Black Tassel', 'Polearm', '3', '38', 'HP', 'Bane of the Soft', 'Increases DMG against slimes by 40/50/60/70/80%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/black-tassel/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:10', '2026-06-05 11:50:10'),
('53ba3808-9f87-4a68-b15e-2a779b1be031', 'Memory of Dust', 'Catalyst', '5', '46', 'ATK', 'Golden Majesty', 'Increase Shield Strength by 20/25/30/35/40%. Scoring hits on opponents increases ATK by 4/5/6/7/8% for 8s. Max 5 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.3s. While protected by a shield, this ATK increase effect is increased by 100%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/memory-of-dust/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:30', '2026-06-05 11:50:30'),
('54576fd2-54f7-4dd9-be1b-e34ef5bed236', 'Skyward Spine', 'Polearm', '5', '48', 'Energy Recharge', 'Black Wing', 'Increases CRIT Rate by 8% and increases Normal ATK SPD by 12%. Additionally, Normal and Charged Attacks hits on enemies have a 50% chance to trigger a vacuum blade that deals 40% of ATK as DMG in a small AoE. This effect can occur no more than once every 2s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/skyward-spine/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:44', '2026-06-05 11:50:44'),
('54c281fa-7def-410b-8358-f0817a5b63a1', 'Ultimate Overlord\'s Mega Magic Sword', 'Claymore', '4', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Melussistance!', 'ATK increased by 12/15/18/21/24%. That\'s not all! The support from all Melusines you\'ve helped in Merusea Village fills you with strength! Based on the number of them you\'ve helped, your ATK is increased by up to an additional 12/15/18/21/24%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/ultimate-overlord-s-mega-magic-sword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:52', '2026-06-05 11:50:52'),
('54d633bb-d053-46c6-9b99-53a01dae6ac9', 'White Tassel', 'Polearm', '3', '39', 'CRIT Rate', 'Sharp', 'Increases Normal Attack DMG by 24/30/36/42/48%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/white-tassel/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:54', '2026-06-05 11:50:54'),
('558605e7-44d2-41c6-841a-e92e9eb44c0b', 'Skyward Harp', 'Bow', '5', '45', 'CRIT Rate', 'Echoing Ballad', 'Increases CRIT DMG by 20/25/30/35/40%. Hits have a 60/70/80/90/100% chance to inflict a small AoE attack, dealing 100% Physical ATK DMG. Can only occur once every 4s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/skyward-harp/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:43', '2026-06-05 11:50:43'),
('576e4d94-2a0a-4ce8-945d-e0cacf818152', 'Freedom-Sworn', 'Sword', '5', '46', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Revolutionary Chorale', 'A part of the \"Millennial Movement\" that wanders amidst the winds. Increases DMG by 10%/12.5%/15%/17.5%/20%. When the character wielding this weapon triggers Elemental Reactions, they gain a Sigil of Rebellion. This effect can be triggered once every 0.5s and can be triggered even if said character is not on the field.When you possess 2 Sigils of Rebellion, all of them will be consumed and all nearby party members will obtain \"Millennial Movement: Song of Resistance\" for 12s. \"Millennial Movement: Song of Resistance\" increases Normal, Charged, and Plunging Attack DMG by 16%/20%/24%/28%/32% and increases ATK by 20%/25%/30%/35%/40%. Once this effect is triggered, you will not gain Sigils of Rebellion for 20s.Of the many effects of the \"Millennial Movement,\" buffs of the same type will not stack.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/freedom-sworn/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:22', '2026-06-05 11:50:22'),
('57f56b9d-ab2e-4e1c-aca4-5d89e4e2cd9d', 'Haran Geppaku Futsu', 'Sword', '5', '46', 'CRIT Rate', 'Honed Flow', 'Obtain 12/15/18/21/24% All Elemental DMG Bonus. When other nearby party members use Elemental Skills, the character equipping this weapon will gain 1 Wavespike stack. Max 2 stacks. This effect can be triggered once every 0.3s. When the character equipping this weapon uses an Elemental Skill, all stacks of Wavespike will be consumed to gain Rippling Upheaval: each stack of Wavespike consumed will increase Normal Attack DMG by 20/25/30/35/40% for 8s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/haran-geppaku-futsu/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:23', '2026-06-05 11:50:23'),
('58728b35-a3fc-415a-b378-5f095c435cf4', 'Wandering Evenstar', 'Catalyst', '4', '42', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Wildling Nightstar', 'The following effect will trigger every 10s: The equipping character will gain 24% of their Elemental Mastery as bonus ATK for 12s, with nearby party members gaining 30% of this buff for the same duration. Multiple instances of this weapon can allow this buff to stack. This effect will still trigger even if the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/wandering-evenstar/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:53', '2026-06-05 11:50:53'),
('58fd7493-60a0-4831-bd46-a87c9a9ea7ce', 'Magic Guide', 'Catalyst', '3', '38', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Bane of Storm and Tide', 'Increases DMG against enemies affected by Hydro or Electro by 12/15/18/21/24%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/magic-guide/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:29', '2026-06-05 11:50:29'),
('596005f1-5a21-461c-859e-3181e0328056', 'The First Great Magic', 'Bow', '5', '46', 'CRIT DMG', 'Parsifal the Great', 'DMG dealt by Charged Attacks increased by 16%. For every party member with the same Elemental Type as the wielder (including the wielder themselves), gain 1 Gimmick stack. For every party member with a different Elemental Type from the wielder, gain 1 Theatrics stack. When the wielder has 1/2/3 or more Gimmick stacks, ATK will be increased by 16%/32%/48%. When the wielder has 1/2/3 or more Theatrics stacks, Movement SPD will be increased by 4%/7%/10%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-first-great-magic/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:48', '2026-06-05 11:50:48'),
('5969b9b6-ad80-448a-a840-238ec56f2d31', 'Waster Greatsword', 'Claymore', '1', '23', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/waster-greatsword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:53', '2026-06-05 11:50:53'),
('5c56b96d-5bb9-4747-b90e-0de659614a12', 'Fading Twilight', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'Energy Recharge', 'Radiance of the Deeps', 'Has three states, Evengleam, Afterglow, and Dawnblaze, which increase DMG dealt from 6%/10%/14% (R1) to 12%/20%/28% (R5) respectively. When attacks hit opponents, this weapon will switch to the next state. This weapon can change states once every 7s. The character equipping this weapon can still trigger the state switch while not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/fading-twilight/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:18', '2026-06-05 11:50:18'),
('5dbc2f6d-1bd0-4df1-85ac-26efc61ab997', 'Skyward Pride', 'Claymore', '5', '45', 'Energy Recharge', 'Sky-Ripping Dragon Spine', 'Increases all DMG by 8/10/12/14/16%. After using an Elemental Burst, Normal or Charged Attack, on hit, creates a vacuum blade that does 80/100/120/140/160% Physical DMG to enemies along its path. Lasts for 20s or 8 vacuum blades.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/skyward-pride/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:44', '2026-06-05 11:50:44'),
('5e5a17f6-917e-442f-a822-5bd75450c808', 'Skyrider Greatsword', 'Claymore', '3', '39', 'Physical DMG Bonus', 'Courage', 'On hit, Normal or Charged Attacks increase ATK by 6/7/8/9/10% for 6s. Max 4 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.5s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/skyrider-greatsword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:42', '2026-06-05 11:50:42'),
('5ee19376-3c89-4784-874f-88272769818f', 'Eye of Perception', 'Catalyst', '4', '41', 'ATK', 'Echo', 'Normal and Charged Attacks have a 50% chance to fire a Bolt of Perception, dealing 240/270/300/330/360% ATK as DMG. This bolt can bounce between enemies a maximum of 4 times. This effect can occur once every 12/11/10/9/8s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/eye-of-perception/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:18', '2026-06-05 11:50:18'),
('60e7108e-d1d3-4539-88bd-82f5228175ee', 'Sharpshooter\'s Oath', 'Bow', '3', '39', 'CRIT DMG', 'Precise', 'Increases DMG against weak spots by 24/30/36/42/48%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/sharpshooter-s-oath/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:42', '2026-06-05 11:50:42'),
('61e24091-cba7-4f1a-8d3f-5f9318759998', 'Ballad Of The Fjords', 'Polearm', '4', '42', 'CRIT Rate', 'Tales of the Tundra', 'When there are at least 3 different Elemental Types in your party, Elemental Mastery will be increased by 120.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/ballad-of-the-fjords/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:10', '2026-06-05 11:50:10'),
('63ef3010-9e4c-4993-a995-2a153cbc2007', 'Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers', 'Catalyst', '3', '39', 'HP', 'Legacy', 'When switching characters, the new character taking the field has their ATK increased by 24/30/36/42/48% for 10s. This effect can only occur once every 20s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/thrilling-tales-of-dragon-slayers/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:50', '2026-06-05 11:50:50'),
('643c7cf0-9670-42d2-b9f7-3f34615238ca', 'Jadefall\'s Splendor', 'Catalyst', '5', '46', 'HP', 'Primordial Jade Regalia', 'For 3s after using an Elemental Burst or creating a shield, the equipping character can gain the Primordial Jade Regalia effect: Restore 4.5/5/5.5/6/6.5 Energy every 2.5s, and gain 0.3/0.5/0.7/0.9/1.1% Elemental DMG Bonus for their corresponding Elemental Type for every 1,000 Max HP they possess, up to 12/20/28/36/44%. Primordial Jade Regalia will still take effect even if the equipping character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/jadefall-s-splendor/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:25', '2026-06-05 11:50:25'),
('6672ad88-8fbc-4ad4-9ade-3502b8a0b955', 'Key of Khaj-Nisut', 'Sword', '5', '44', 'HP', 'Sunken Song of the Sands', 'HP increased by 20%. When an Elemental Skill hits opponents, you gain the Grand Hymn effect for 20s. This effect increases the equipping character\'s Elemental Mastery by 0.12% of their Max HP. This effect can trigger once every 0.3s. Max 3 stacks. When this effect gains 3 stacks, or when the third stack\'s duration is refreshed, the Elemental Mastery of all nearby party members will be increased by 0.2% of the equipping character\'s max HP for 20s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/key-of-khaj-nisut/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:26', '2026-06-05 11:50:26'),
('67309564-d25a-400b-9147-b661e0d2183b', 'Vortex Vanquisher', 'Polearm', '5', '46', 'ATK', 'Golden Majesty', 'Increases Shield Strength by 20/25/30/35/40%, scoring hits on opponents increases ATK by 4/5/6/7/8% for 8s. Max 5 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.3s. While protected by a shield this ATK increase effect is increased by 100%', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/vortex-vanquisher/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:53', '2026-06-05 11:50:53'),
('690ea203-cbf9-4d10-990b-03dc6d80966c', 'Royal Grimoire', 'Catalyst', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'Focus', 'Upon damaging an enemy, increases CRIT Rate by 8%. Max 5 stacks. A CRIT hit removes all stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/royal-grimoire/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:38', '2026-06-05 11:50:38'),
('6a904ee3-5d73-4fff-a15b-f0cae31fb3da', 'Mitternachts Waltz', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'Physical DMG Bonus', 'Evernight Duet', 'Normal Attack hits on opponents increase Elemental Skill DMG by 20/25/30/35/40% for 5s. Elemental Skill hits on opponents increase Normal Attack DMG by 20/25/30/35/40% for 5s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/mitternachts-waltz/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:31', '2026-06-05 11:50:31'),
('6ab10cc5-b0b4-4897-9f5e-8597d8a010f0', 'Skyrider Sword', 'Sword', '3', '38', 'Energy Recharge', 'Determination', 'Using an Elemental Burst grants a 12/15/18/21/24% increase in ATK and Movement SPD for 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/skyrider-sword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:43', '2026-06-05 11:50:43'),
('6c1726c2-706f-4168-bec0-d38dfa1a6545', 'Lithic Spear', 'Polearm', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Lithic Axiom - Unity', 'For every character in the party who hails from Liyue, the character who equips this weapon gains 7/8/9/10/11% ATK increase and a 3/4/5/6/7% CRIT Rate increase. This effect stacks up to 4 times.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/lithic-spear/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:28', '2026-06-05 11:50:28'),
('6ca35e5d-69ea-45cf-b7cf-f871ae300776', 'Hunter\'s Bow', 'Bow', '1', '23', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/hunter-s-bow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:24', '2026-06-05 11:50:24'),
('6cc21ea8-7dd7-4fe0-a953-e0640141a67a', 'Favonius Warbow', 'Bow', '4', '41', 'Energy Recharge', 'Windfall', 'CRIT hits have a 60/70/80/90/100% chance to generate 1 Elemental Orb, which will regenerate 6 Energy for the character. Can only occur once every 12/10.5/9/7.5/6s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/favonius-warbow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:20', '2026-06-05 11:50:20'),
('6d48f099-1543-46d2-abc0-3e902b843fc7', 'Cinnabar Spindle', 'Sword', '4', '41', 'DEF', 'Spotless Heart', 'Elemental Skill DMG is increased by 40/50/60/70/80% of DEF. The effect will be triggered no more than once every 1.5s and will be cleared 0.1s after the Elemental Skill deals DMG.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/cinnabar-spindle/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:13', '2026-06-05 11:50:13'),
('6f261fb8-dcb7-48ea-b83c-701c33af8386', 'Dragonspine Spear', 'Polearm', '4', '41', 'Physical DMG Bonus', 'Frost Burial', 'Hitting an opponent with Normal and Charged Attacks has a 60% chance of forming and dropping an Everfrost Icicle above them, dealing 80% AoE ATK DMG. Opponents affected by Cryo are dealt 200% ATK DMG. Can only occur once every 10s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/dragonspine-spear/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:16', '2026-06-05 11:50:16'),
('6f3c74b0-988b-4b81-b0e5-485c5e9844b2', 'Old Merc\'s Pal', 'Claymore', '2', '33', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/old-merc-s-pal/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:32', '2026-06-05 11:50:32'),
('718fa98e-cdb6-448c-a3db-3c0794149c04', 'Windblume Ode', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Windblume Wish', 'After using an Elemental Skill, receive a boon from the ancient wish of the Windblume, increasing ATK by 16/20/24/28/32% for 6s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/windblume-ode/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:55', '2026-06-05 11:50:55'),
('72d72e63-971e-43bd-b90a-0bb79d43e111', 'Primordial Jade Cutter', 'Sword', '5', '44', 'CRIT Rate', 'Protector\'s Virtue', 'HP increased by 20%/25%/30%/35%/40%. Additionally, provides an ATK Bonus based on 1.2%/1.5%/1.8%/2.1%/2.4% of the wielder\'s Max HP.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/primordial-jade-cutter/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:33', '2026-06-05 11:50:33'),
('72e4a2a3-250f-4cf7-be0f-16a136d8eeaf', 'Lion\'s Roar', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Bane of Fire and Thunder', 'Increases DMG against enemies affected by Pyro or Electro by 20/24/28/32/36%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/lion-s-roar/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:27', '2026-06-05 11:50:27'),
('780724b4-aa56-44e0-97a6-fa727aa2902b', 'Favonius Greatsword', 'Claymore', '4', '41', 'Energy Recharge', 'Windfall', 'CRIT hits have a 60/70/80/90/100% chance to generate 1 Elemental Orb, which will regenerate 6 Energy for the character. Can only occur once every 12/10.5/9/7.5/6s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/favonius-greatsword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:19', '2026-06-05 11:50:19'),
('7b48e5b8-d2eb-4c43-a99d-732a4865ff10', 'Akuoumaru', 'Claymore', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Watatsumi Wavewalker', 'For every point of the entire party\'s combined maximum Energy capacity, the Elemental Burst DMG of the character equipping this weapon is increased by 0.12/0.15/0.18/0.21/0.24%. A maximum of 40/50/60/70/80% increased Elemental Burst DMG can be achieved this way.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/akuoumaru/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:07', '2026-06-05 11:50:07'),
('7b55081c-b11a-4596-bf6d-beb31a3ff035', 'Harbinger of Dawn', 'Sword', '3', '39', 'CRIT DMG', 'Vigorous', 'When HP is above 90%, increases CRIT Rate by 14/18/22/24/28%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/harbinger-of-dawn/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:23', '2026-06-05 11:50:23'),
('7b55ec52-2601-4c91-8b19-ad8a8e27a79f', 'Talking Stick', 'Claymore', '4', '44', 'CRIT Rate', 'The Silver Tongue', 'ATK will be increased by 16% for 15s after being affected by Pyro. This effect can be triggered once every 12s. All Elemental DMG Bonus will be increased by 12% for 15s after being affected by Hydro, Cryo, Electro, or Dendro. This effect can be triggered once every 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/talking-stick/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:47', '2026-06-05 11:50:47'),
('7bf555f4-9bf8-4d60-8b09-16587c154703', 'Lithic Blade', 'Claymore', '4', '41', 'CRIT DMG', 'Lithic Axiom - Unity', 'For every character in the party who hails from Liyue, the character who equips this weapon gains 6/7/8/9/10% ATK increase and 2/3/4/5/6% CRIT Rate increase.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/lithic-blade/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:27', '2026-06-05 11:50:27'),
('7d05e7db-7e28-48f0-8d42-fb24e3731325', 'Mistsplitter Reforged', 'Sword', '5', '48', 'CRIT DMG', 'Mistsplitter\'s Edge', 'Gain a 12% Elemental DMG Bonus for every element and receive the might of Mistsplitter\'s Emblem. At stack levels 1/2/3, Mistsplitter\'s Emblem provides a 8/16/28% Elemental DMG Bonus for the character\'s Elemental Type. The character will obtain 1 stack of Mistsplitter\'s Emblem in each of the following scenarios: Normal Attack deals Elemental DMG (stack lasts 5s), casting Elemental Burst (stack lasts 10s); Energy is less than 100% (stack disappears when Energy is full). Each stack\'s duration is calculated independently.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/mistsplitter-reforged/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:30', '2026-06-05 11:50:30'),
('7d734dc7-cf84-4945-95ae-aa67173dd8ac', 'Royal Bow', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Focus', 'Upon damaging an enemy, increases CRIT Rate by 8%. Max 5 stacks. A CRIT hit removes all stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/royal-bow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:38', '2026-06-05 11:50:38'),
('7dbd4647-7fe7-46a5-9398-f22627303510', 'Staff of Homa', 'Polearm', '5', '46', 'CRIT DMG', 'Reckless Cinnabar', 'HP increased by 20/25/30/35/40%. Additionally, provides an ATK Bonus based on 0.8/1/1.2/1.4/1.6% of the wielder\'s Max HP. When the wielder\'s HP is less than 50%, this ATK Bonus is increased by an additional 1/1.2/1.4/1.6/1.8% of Max HP.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/staff-of-homa/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:46', '2026-06-05 11:50:46'),
('7f37d8eb-9400-43ec-9261-cba3ca56751a', 'Blackcliff Warbow', 'Bow', '4', '44', 'CRIT DMG', 'Press the Advantage', 'After defeating an enemy, ATK is increased by 12/15/18/21/24% for 30s. This effect has a maximum of 3 stacks, and the duration of each stack is independent of the others.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/blackcliff-warbow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:12', '2026-06-05 11:50:12'),
('8442217c-b54b-4161-bb71-ac91042aaab0', 'Wolf\'s Gravestone', 'Claymore', '5', '46', 'ATK', 'Wolfish Tracker', 'Increases Base ATK by 20/25/30/35/40%. On hit, attacks against enemies with less than 30% HP increase all party members\' Base ATK by 40/50/60/70/80% for 12s. Can only occur once every 30s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/wolf-s-gravestone/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:55', '2026-06-05 11:50:55'),
('880266be-1d5c-4822-8b0b-74c0f1d40b14', 'Moonpiercer', 'Polearm', '5', '44', 'CRIT Rate', 'Heat Haze at Horizon\'s End', 'The equipping character gains 52% of their Elemental Mastery as bonus ATK. When an Elemental Skill hits opponents, the Dream of the Scarlet Sands effect will be gained for 10s: The equipping character will gain 28% of their Elemental Mastery as bonus ATK. Max 3 stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/staff-of-the-scarlet-sands/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:46', '2026-06-05 11:50:46'),
('8871cecc-8d0f-415d-a4db-29ab94a85d6a', 'Hamayumi', 'Bow', '4', '41', 'ATK', 'Full Draw', 'Increases Normal Attack DMG by 16/20/24/28/32% and Charged Attack DMG by 12/15/18/21/24%. When the equipping character\'s Energy reaches 100%, this effect is increased by 100%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/hamayumi/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:23', '2026-06-05 11:50:23'),
('8ecb447c-5701-47b6-910e-b83f00db2323', 'Solar Pearl', 'Catalyst', '4', '42', 'CRIT Rate', 'Solar Shine', 'Normal Attack hits increase Elemental Skill and Elemental Burst DMG by 20/25/30/35/40% for 6s. Likewise, Elemental Skill or Elemental Burst hits increase Normal Attack DMG by 20/25/30/35/40% for 6s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/solar-pearl/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:45', '2026-06-05 11:50:45'),
('8f4109d7-00b3-4505-8e3b-b862ba93c63b', 'Sacrificial Greatsword', 'Claymore', '4', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Composed', 'After damaging an opponent with an Elemental Skill, the skill has a 40/50/60/70/80% chance to end its own CD. Can only occur once every 30/26/22/18/14s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/sacrificial-greatsword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:40', '2026-06-05 11:50:40'),
('8feafc01-658e-4891-b39f-777c30d9a58e', 'Wavebreaker\'s Fin', 'Polearm', '4', '45', 'ATK', 'Watatsumi Wavewalker', 'For every point of the entire party\'s combined maximum Energy capacity, the Elemental Burst DMG of the character equipping this weapon is increased by 0.12/0.15/0.18/0.21/0.24%. A maximum of 40/50/60/70/80% increased Elemental Burst DMG can be achieved this way.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/wavebreaker-s-fin/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:54', '2026-06-05 11:50:54'),
('91e7bee0-05a9-4343-8e20-494451f8e007', 'Thundering Pulse', 'Bow', '5', '46', 'CRIT DMG', 'Rule By Thunder', 'Increases ATK by 20% and grants the might of the Thunder Emblem. At stack levels 1/2/3, the Thunder Emblem increases Normal Attack DMG by 12/24/40%. The character will obtain 1 stack of Thunder Emblem in each of the following scenarios: Normal Attack deals DMG (stack lasts 5s), casting Elemental Skill (stack lasts 10s); Energy is less than 100% (stack disappears when Energy is full). Each stack\'s duration is calculated independently.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/thundering-pulse/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:50', '2026-06-05 11:50:50'),
('91e7d7a5-086d-4f73-b302-0b8f1fc7c0f7', 'Frostbearer', 'Catalyst', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'No Passive', 'Hitting an opponent with Normal and Charged Attacks has a 60% chance of forming and dropping an Everfrost Icicle above them, dealing 80% AoE ATK DMG. Opponents affected by Cryo are dealt 200% ATK DMG. Can only occur once every 10s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/frostbearer/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:22', '2026-06-05 11:50:22');
INSERT INTO `weapon` (`weaponID`, `name`, `type`, `rarity`, `baseAttack`, `subStat`, `passiveName`, `passiveDesc`, `image_url`, `price`, `stock`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
('96879bbe-be6d-4c3f-b747-960e702ee407', 'Fruit of Fulfillment', 'Catalyst', '4', '42', 'Energy Recharge', 'Full Circle', 'Obtain the \'Wax and Wane\' effect after an Elemental Reaction is triggered, gaining 24 Elemental Mastery while losing 5% ATK. For every 0.3s, 1 stack of Wax and Wane can be gained. Max 5 stacks. For every 6s that go by without an Elemental Reaction being triggered, 1 stack will be lost. This effect can be triggered even when the character is off-field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/fruit-of-fulfillment/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:22', '2026-06-05 11:50:22'),
('96e7541a-5a43-4561-927f-2c31e4f0022e', 'The Dockhand\'s Assistant', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'HP', 'Sea Shanty', 'When the wielder is healed or heals others, they will gain a Stoic\'s Symbol that lasts 30s, up to a maximum of 3 Symbols. When using their Elemental Skill or Burst, all Symbols will be consumed and the Roused effect will be granted for 10s. For each Symbol consumed, gain 40/50/60/70/80 Elemental Mastery, and 2s after the effect occurs, 2/2.5/3/3.5/4 Energy per Symbol consumed will be restored for said character. The Roused effect can be triggered once every 15s, and Symbols can be gained even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-dockhands-assistant/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:48', '2026-06-05 11:50:48'),
('9bae3fa1-babb-4f4a-a25f-08d3a21ea5bc', 'Sacrificial Sword', 'Sword', '4', '41', 'Energy Recharge', 'Composed', 'After damaging an opponent with an Elemental Skill, the skill has a 40/50/60/70/80% chance to end its own CD. Can only occur once every 30/26/22/18/14s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/sacrificial-sword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:41', '2026-06-05 11:50:41'),
('9bc55d39-6315-4e07-af30-62df6aa561b4', 'Primordial Jade Winged-Spear', 'Polearm', '5', '48', 'CRIT Rate', 'Eagle Spear of Justice', 'On hit, increases ATK by 3.2/3.9/4.6/5.3/6% for 6s. Max 7 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.3s. Full stacks increase Skill DMG by 12/16/20/24/28%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/primordial-jade-winged-spear/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:33', '2026-06-05 11:50:33'),
('9d52ebf3-c4da-43d6-aa86-efed1f399660', 'Mappa Mare', 'Catalyst', '4', '44', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Infusion Scroll', 'Triggering an Elemental reaction grants a 8/10/12/14/16% Elemental DMG Bonus for 10s. Max 2 stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/mappa-mare/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:29', '2026-06-05 11:50:29'),
('9ed3fc26-75a5-4e50-b3bb-82a3003daa31', 'Lost Prayer to the Sacred Winds', 'Catalyst', '5', '44', 'CRIT Rate', 'Boundless Blessing', 'Increases Movement SPD by 10%. When in battle, earn a 6/8/10/12/14% Elemental DMG Bonus every 4s. Max 4 stacks. Lasts until the character falls or leaves combat.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/lost-prayer-to-the-sacred-winds/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:28', '2026-06-05 11:50:28'),
('9f9202b2-49b4-4a72-af71-40b2a3f82aad', 'Rust', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Rapid Firing', 'Increases Normal Attack DMG by 40/50/60/70/80% but decreases Aimed Shot DMG by 8/9/10/11/12%', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/rust/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:39', '2026-06-05 11:50:39'),
('9ff1e43d-863b-4249-b006-6a00f58f26d5', 'Moonpiercer', 'Polearm', '4', '44', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Stillwood Moonshadow', 'After triggering Burning, Quicken, Aggravate, Spread, Bloom, Hyperbloom, or Burgeon, a Leaf of Revival will be created around the character for a maximum of 10s. When picked up, the Leaf will grant the character 16% ATK for 12s. Only 1 Leaf can be generated this way every 20s. This effect can still be triggered if the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/moonpiercer/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:31', '2026-06-05 11:50:31'),
('a12876ac-d415-46c8-9bb0-6d5e33c250c7', 'Song of Broken Pines', 'Claymore', '5', '49', 'Physical DMG Bonus', 'Rebel\'s Banner Hymn', 'A part of the \'Millennial Movement\' that wanders amidst the winds. Increases ATK by 16%, and when Normal or Charged Attacks hit opponents, the character gains a Sigil of Whispers. This effect can be triggered once every 0.3s. When you possess four Sigils of \'Whispers, all of them will be consumed and all nearby party members will obtain the \'Millennial Movement: Banner-Hymn\' effect for 12s. \'Millennial Movement: Banner-Hymn\' increases Normal ATK SPD by 12% and increases ATK by 20%. Once this effect is triggered, you will not gain Sigils of Whispers for 20s. Of the many effects of the \'Millennial Movement\', buffs of the same type will not stack.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/song-of-broken-pines/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:45', '2026-06-05 11:50:45'),
('a3c6832a-e2a7-4e2d-8be7-455b39953900', 'Apprentice\'s Notes', 'Catalyst', '1', '23', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/apprentice-s-notes/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:09', '2026-06-05 11:50:09'),
('a58cb948-0602-4751-b97b-92e9e09f5a9c', 'King\'s Squire', 'Bow', '4', '41', 'ATK', 'Labyrinth Lord\'s Instruction', 'Obtain the Teachings of the Forest effect when unleashing Elemental Skills and Bursts, increasing Elemental Mastery by 60 for 12s. This effect will be removed when switching characters. When the Teachings of the Forest effect ends or is removed, it will deal 100% of ATK as DMG to 1 nearby opponent. The Teachings of the Forest effect can be triggered once every 20s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/king-s-squire/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:26', '2026-06-05 11:50:26'),
('a592d082-1b6c-492d-93aa-11bb9017dba5', 'Ferrous Shadow', 'Claymore', '3', '39', 'HP', 'Unbending', 'When HP falls below 70/75/80/85/90%, increases Charged Attack DMG by 30/35/40/45/50%, and Charged Attacks become much harder to interrupt.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/ferrous-shadow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:20', '2026-06-05 11:50:20'),
('a84d339e-1621-43a5-a51f-2b9105e60be6', 'The Bell', 'Claymore', '4', '42', 'HP', 'Rebellious Guardian', 'Taking DMG generates a shield which absorbs DMG up to 20/23/26/29/32% of Max HP. This shield lasts for 10s or until broken, and can only be triggered once every 45s. While protected by the shield, the character gains 12/15/18/21/24% increased DMG.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-bell/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:47', '2026-06-05 11:50:47'),
('ac7b445f-3538-4025-8ff3-2a6000219700', 'Iron Sting', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Infusion Stinger', 'Dealing Elemental DMG increases all DMG by 6% for 6s. Max 2 stacks. Can only occur once every 1s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/iron-sting/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:25', '2026-06-05 11:50:25'),
('ae5e2238-0da3-400e-9527-2a10b4e5347d', 'Iron Point', 'Polearm', '2', '33', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/iron-point/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:24', '2026-06-05 11:50:24'),
('afa7cd21-3b03-4d0d-9ee9-17ae0fbe88d0', 'Ebony Bow', 'Bow', '3', '40', 'ATK', 'Decimate', 'Increases DMG against mechanoid Ruin enemies by 40/50/60/70/80%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/ebony-bow/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:17', '2026-06-05 11:50:17'),
('b7418a5d-41e2-4c79-b839-b2bd9bc3b6f1', 'Prospector\'s Drill', 'Polearm', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'Masons\' Ditty', 'When the wielder is healed or heals others, they will gain a Unity\'s Symbol that lasts 30s, up to a maximum of 3 Symbols. When using their Elemental Skill or Burst, all Symbols will be consumed and the Struggle effect will be granted for 10s. For each Symbol consumed, gain 3/4/5/6/7% ATK and 7/8.5/10/11.5/13% All Elemental DMG Bonus. The Struggle effect can be triggered once every 15s, and Symbols can be gained even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/prospectors-drill/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:34', '2026-06-05 11:50:34'),
('b7b550d5-9550-45a2-94d7-adebffd6875f', 'Aqua Simulacra', 'Bow', '5', '44', 'CRIT DMG', 'The Cleansing Form', 'HP is increased by 16%. When there are opponents nearby, the DMG dealt by the wielder of this weapon is increased by 20%. This will take effect whether the character is on-field or not.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/aqua-simulacra/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:09', '2026-06-05 11:50:09'),
('b7d34cc3-2d38-46e4-8d84-d60ae0288a60', 'Tome of the Eternal Flow', 'Catalyst', '5', '44', 'CRIT DMG', 'Aeon Wave', 'HP is increased by 16/20/24/28/32%. When current HP increases or decreases, Charged Attack DMG will be increased by 14/18/22/26/30% for 4s. Max 3 stacks, can be triggered once every 0.3s. When you have 3 stacks or refresh a third stack\'s duration, 8/9/10/11/12 Energy will be restored. This Energy restoration effect can be triggered once every 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/tome-of-the-eternal/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:51', '2026-06-05 11:50:51'),
('b82fc3bb-9c3b-4572-b590-fb8d27c7e568', 'Prototype Starglitter', 'Polearm', '4', '42', 'Energy Recharge', 'Magic Affinity', 'After using an Elemental Skill, increases Normal and Charged Attack DMG by 8% for 12s. Max 2 stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/prototype-starglitter/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:36', '2026-06-05 11:50:36'),
('b9cbcfda-481e-4b64-b4ef-0fab7096314d', 'Scion Of The Blazing Sun', 'Bow', '4', '44', 'CRIT Rate', 'The Way of Sunfire', 'After a Charged Attack hits an opponent, a Sunfire Arrow will descend upon the opponent hit, dealing 60% ATK as DMG, and applying the Heartsearer effect to the opponent damaged by said Arrow for 10s. Opponents affected by Heartsearer take 28% more Charged Attack DMG from the wielder. A Sunfire Arrow can be triggered once every 10s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/scion-of-the-blazing-sun/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:41', '2026-06-05 11:50:41'),
('ba2f7b3a-092a-4d53-952b-a8075f12b590', 'Finale Of The Deep', 'Sword', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'An End Sublime', 'When using an Elemental Skill, ATK will be increased by 12% for 15s, and a Bond of Life worth 25% of Max HP will be granted. This effect can be triggered once every 10s. When the Bond of Life is cleared, a maximum of 150 ATK will be gained based on 2.4% of the Bond when cleared for 15s. Bond of Life: Absorbs healing for the character based on its base value, and clears after healing equal to this value is obtained.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/finale-of-the-deep/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:21', '2026-06-05 11:50:21'),
('ba6f8824-6405-49c2-b10c-3dbd86d079ec', 'Missive Windspear', 'Polearm', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'The Wind Unattained', 'Within 10s after an Elemental Reaction is triggered, ATK is increased by 12/15/18/21/24% and Elemental Mastery is increased by 48/60/72/84/96.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/missive-windspear/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:30', '2026-06-05 11:50:30'),
('bb0f3243-44a9-4e99-932f-bef3c58117f0', 'Quartz', 'Claymore', '3', '40', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Residual Heat', 'Upon causing an Overloaded, Melt, Burning, Vaporize, or a Pyro-infused Swirl reaction, increases Base ATK by 20/25/30/35/40% for 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/quartz/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:36', '2026-06-05 11:50:36'),
('bb54c8da-7c1f-438e-b4a3-0ceb7a814bf6', 'Royal Longsword', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'ATK', 'Focus', 'Upon damaging an enemy, increases CRIT Rate by 8%. Max 5 stacks. A CRIT hit removes all stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/royal-longsword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:38', '2026-06-05 11:50:38'),
('bb7cf765-0230-431a-9e0a-c4596187e13a', 'Luxurious Sea-Lord', 'Claymore', '4', '41', 'ATK', 'Oceanic Victory', 'Increases Elemental Burst DMG by 12/15/18/21/24%. When Elemental Burst hits opponents, there is a 100% chance of summoning a huge onrush of tuna that charges and deals 100/125/150/175/200% ATK as AoE DMG. This effect can occur once every 15s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/luxurious-sea-lord/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:28', '2026-06-05 11:50:28'),
('bcb640c0-96aa-41d9-bccb-5938d884bc32', 'Hunter\'s Path', 'Bow', '5', '44', 'CRIT Rate', 'At the End of the Beast-Paths', 'Gain 12% All Elemental DMG Bonus. Obtain the Tireless Hunt effect after hitting an opponent with a Charged Attack. This effect increases Charged Attack DMG by 160% of Elemental Mastery. This effect will be removed after 12 Charged Attacks or 10s. Only 1 instance of Tireless Hunt can be gained every 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/hunter-s-path/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:24', '2026-06-05 11:50:24'),
('bdb51493-9600-4dba-936e-cccf3741a905', 'Emerald Orb', 'Catalyst', '3', '40', 'Elemental Mastery', 'Rapids', 'Upon causing a Vaporize, Electro-Charged, Frozen, or a Hydro-infused Swirl reaction, increases Base ATK by 20/25/30/35/40% for 12s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/emerald-orb/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:17', '2026-06-05 11:50:17'),
('bef7a5db-fec2-4943-bd23-dfddac358635', 'Blackcliff Agate', 'Catalyst', '4', '42', 'CRIT DMG', 'Press the Advantage', 'After defeating an enemy, ATK is increased by 12/15/18/21/24% for 30s. This effect has a maximum of 3 stacks, and the duration of each stack is independent of the others.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/blackcliff-amulet/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:11', '2026-06-05 11:50:11'),
('c0071b0d-9735-4663-9772-a59dd6a6735c', 'Light of Foliar Incision', 'Sword', '5', '44', 'CRIT DMG', 'Whitemoon Bristle', 'CRIT Rate is increased by 4%. After Normal Attacks deal Elemental DMG, the Foliar Incision effect will be obtained, increasing DMG dealt by Normal Attacks and Elemental Skills by 120% of Elemental Mastery.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/light-of-foliar-incision/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:27', '2026-06-05 11:50:27'),
('c0dbf2f2-c1a1-4daf-ad44-b38529f7384b', 'Rightful Reward', 'Polearm', '4', '44', 'HP', 'Tip of the Spear', 'When the wielder is healed, restore 8 Energy. This effect can be triggered once every 10s, and can occur even when the character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/rightful-reward/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:37', '2026-06-05 11:50:37'),
('c23bda78-ebdf-4d86-a2f7-340c54c94a89', 'Lumidouce Elegy', 'Polearm', '5', '46', 'CRIT Rate', 'Bright Dawn Overture', 'ATK increased by 15%. After the equipping character triggers Burning on an opponent or deals Dendro DMG to Burning opponents, the DMG dealt is increased by 18%. This effect lasts for 8s, max 2 stacks. When 2 stacks are reached or when the duration is refreshed at 2 stacks, restore 12 Energy. Energy can be restored this way once every 12s. The 2 aforementioned effects can be triggered even when the character is off-field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/lumidouce-elegy/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:28', '2026-06-05 11:50:28'),
('c490b059-7019-49ef-863a-ece6ec432775', 'Calamity Queller', 'Polearm', '5', '49', 'ATK', 'Extinguishing Precept', 'Gain 12/15/18/21/24% All Elemental DMG Bonus. Obtain Consummation for 20s after using an Elemental Skill, causing ATK to increase by 3.2/4/4.8/5.6/6.4% per second. This ATK increase has a maximum of 6 stacks. When the character equipped with this weapon is not on the field, Consummation\'s ATK increase is doubled.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/calamity-queller/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:12', '2026-06-05 11:50:12'),
('c5be9cbd-f6e5-4e45-ae22-894201157b10', 'Ballad of the Boundless Blue', 'Catalyst', '4', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Azure Skies', 'Within 6s after Normal or Charged Attacks hit an opponent, Normal Attack DMG will be increased by 8/10/12/14/16% and Charged Attack DMG will be increased by 6/7.5/9/10.5/12%. Max 3 stacks. This effect can be triggered once every 0.3s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/ballad-of-the-boundless-blue/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:09', '2026-06-05 11:50:09'),
('c613858d-4379-456b-a2e2-7fd61c866d20', 'Beginner\'s Protector', 'Polearm', '1', '23', '-', '-', '-', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/beginner-s-protector/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:10', '2026-06-05 11:50:10'),
('ca9770e2-1693-42b6-9612-c15195c6de5e', 'Hakushin Ring', 'Catalyst', '4', '44', 'Energy Recharge', 'Sakura Saiguu', 'After the character equipped with this weapon triggers an Electro elemental reaction, nearby party members of an Elemental Type involved in the elemental reaction receive a 10/12.5/15/17.5/20% Elemental DMG Bonus for their element, lasting 6s. Elemental Bonuses gained in this way cannot be stacked.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/hakushin-ring/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:22', '2026-06-05 11:50:22'),
('cb987b09-569c-4007-ad72-2344326d3d37', 'Otherworldly Story', 'Catalyst', '3', '39', 'Energy Recharge', 'Energy Shower', 'Each Elemental Orb or Particle collected restores 1/1.25/1.5/1.75/2% HP.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/otherworldly-story/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:32', '2026-06-05 11:50:32'),
('cc5de2aa-8406-4973-937c-3f2c5f8e1d2e', 'The Widsith', 'Catalyst', '4', '42', 'CRIT DMG', 'Debut', 'When the character takes the field, they gain a random theme song for 10s:\nRecitative: Increases Base ATK by 60%\nInterlude: Elemental Mastery is increased by 240\nAria: Increases all Elemental DMG by 48%\nCan only occur once every 30s', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-widsith/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:50', '2026-06-05 11:50:50'),
('cd1d5c17-ead7-4de1-b5e9-9f4d0e5f9268', 'Oathsworn Eye', 'Catalyst', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'People of the Faltering Light', 'Increases Energy Recharge by 24/30/36/42/48% for 10s after using an Elemental Skill.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/oathsworn-eye/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:31', '2026-06-05 11:50:31'),
('cd87dbb7-7e02-40d5-b8e2-e14b2b4baeb3', 'Snow-Tombed Starsilver', 'Claymore', '4', '44', 'Physical DMG Bonus', 'Frost Burial', 'Hitting an opponent with Normal and Charged Attacks has a 60% chance of forming and dropping an Everfrost Icicle above them, dealing 80% AoE ATK DMG. Opponents affected by Cryo are dealt 200% ATK DMG. Can only occur once every 10s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/snow-tombed-starsilver/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:44', '2026-06-05 11:50:44'),
('cd93f3dc-954c-4544-b828-c5e4f68ac206', 'The Unforged', 'Claymore', '5', '46', 'ATK', 'Golden Majesty', 'Increases Shield Strength by 20/25/30/35/40%, scoring hits on opponents increases ATK by 4/5/6/7/8% for 8s. Max 5 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.3s. While protected by a shield this ATK increase effect is increased by 100%', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-unforged/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:49', '2026-06-05 11:50:49'),
('cf4ec1ac-0450-44d7-8c15-fb6df017c915', 'Wolf-Fang', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'CRIT Rate', 'Northwind Wolf', 'DMG dealt by Elemental Skill and Elemental Burst is increased by 16%. When an Elemental Skill hits an opponent, its CRIT Rate will be increased by 2%. When an Elemental Burst hits an opponent, its CRIT Rate will be increased by 2%. Both of these effects last 10s separately, have 4 max stacks, and can be triggered once every 0.1s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/wolf-fang/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:55', '2026-06-05 11:50:55'),
('d142549e-e69f-4f82-aa27-98aeb43c1a0e', 'Crane\'s Echoing Call', 'Catalyst', '5', '49', 'ATK', 'Cloudfall Axiom', 'After the equipping character hits an opponent with a Plunging Attack, all nearby party members\' Plunging Attacks will deal 28% increased DMG for 20s. When nearby party members hit opponents with Plunging Attacks, they will restore 2.5/2.75/3/3.25/3.5 Energy to the equipping character. Energy can restored this way every 0.7s. This energy regain effect can be triggered even if the equipping character is not on the field.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/crane-s-echoing-call/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:14', '2026-06-05 11:50:14'),
('d42ec7a2-a180-4ad2-8f2d-a9e70e60b5be', 'Verdict', 'Claymore', '5', '48', 'CRIT Rate', 'Many Oaths of Dawn and Dusk', 'Increases ATK by 20/25/30/35/40%. When characters in your party obtain Elemental Shards from Crystallize reactions, the equipping character will gain 1 Seal, increasing Elemental Skill DMG by 18/22.5/27/31.5/36%. The Seal lasts for 15s, and the equipped may have up to 2 Seals at once. All of the equipper\'s Seals will disappear 0.2s after their Elemental Skill deals DMG.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/verdict/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:53', '2026-06-05 11:50:53'),
('d464dd5c-52d9-4865-b614-33440c17d088', 'Uraku Misugiri', 'Sword', '5', '44', 'CRIT DMG', 'Brocade Bloom, Shrine Sword', 'Normal Attack DMG is increased by 16/20/24/28/32% and Elemental Skill DMG is increased by 24/30/36/42/48%. After a nearby active character deals Geo DMG, the aforementioned effects increase by 100% for 15s. Additionally, the wielder\'s DEF is increased by 20/25/30/35/40%.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/uraku-misugiri/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:52', '2026-06-05 11:50:52'),
('d7740597-724f-432f-a61e-8e73ae4cd8a5', 'Skyward Atlas', 'Catalyst', '5', '45', 'ATK', 'Wandering Clouds', 'Increases Elemental DMG Bonus by 12/15/18/21/24%. Normal Attack hits have a 50% chance to earn the favor of the clouds. which actively seek out nearby enemies to attack for 15s, dealing 160/200/240/280/320% ATK DMG. Can only occur once every 30s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/skyward-atlas/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:43', '2026-06-05 11:50:43'),
('d78ca1f7-1375-4702-80a8-80a356e3011e', 'Twin Nephrite', 'Catalyst', '3', '40', 'CRIT Rate', 'Guerilla Tactic', 'Defeating an enemy increases Movement SPD and ATK by 12/14/16/18/20% for 15s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/twin-nephrite/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:52', '2026-06-05 11:50:52'),
('d7dfbc60-825b-4b87-ba15-4680533d3aa6', 'Prototype Archaic', 'Claymore', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'Crush', 'On hit, Normal or Charged Attacks have a 50% chance to deal an additional 240/300/360/420/480% ATK DMG to enemies within a small radius. Can only occur once every 15s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/prototype-archaic/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:34', '2026-06-05 11:50:34'),
('d8823f27-0c4b-42cd-a97d-3a5b9d57cfd3', 'Royal Spear', 'Polearm', '4', '44', 'ATK', 'Focus', 'Upon damaging an opponent, increases CRIT Rate by 8%. Max 5 stacks. A CRIT Hit removes all stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/royal-spear/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:39', '2026-06-05 11:50:39'),
('da3aee1b-afe5-4128-b34b-5cc05687d998', 'Elegy for the End', 'Bow', '5', '46', 'Energy Recharge', 'The Parting Refrain!', 'A part of the \'Millennial Movement\' that wanders amidst the winds. Increases Elemental Mastery by 60. When the Elemental Skills or Elemental Bursts of the character wielding this weapon hit opponents, that character gains a Sigil of Remembrance. This effect can be triggered once every 0.2s and can be triggered even if said character is not on the field. When you possess 4 Sigils of Remembrance, all of them will be consumed and all nearby party members will obtain the \'Millennial Movement: Farewell Song\' effect for 12s. \'Millennial Movement: Farewell Song\' increases Elemental Mastery by 100 and increases ATK by 20%. Once this effect is triggered, you will not gain Sigils of Remembrance for 20s. Of the many effects of the \'Millennial Movement,\' buffs of the same type will not stack.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/elegy-for-the-end/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:17', '2026-06-05 11:50:17'),
('dadef9a8-0c76-4733-abdf-d60c63aa393c', 'Royal Greatsword', 'Claymore', '4', '43', 'ATK', 'Focus', 'Upon damaging an enemy, increases CRIT Rate by 8%. Max 5 stacks. A CRIT hit removes all stacks.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/royal-greatsword/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:38', '2026-06-05 11:50:38'),
('dae9697c-db31-47ac-a562-d8cf183721c8', 'Sword of Descension', 'Sword', '4', '39', 'ATK', 'Descension', 'Hitting enemies with Normal or Charged Attacks grants a 50% chance to deal 200% ATK as DMG in a small AoE. This effect can only occur once every 10s. Additionally, if the Traveler equips the Sword of Descension, their ATK is increased by 66.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/sword-of-descension/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:46', '2026-06-05 11:50:46'),
('db35a1de-c767-4276-a270-abdacd848c15', 'Whiteblind', 'Claymore', '4', '42', 'DEF', 'Infusion Blade', 'On hit, Normal or Charged Attacks increase Base ATK and DEF by 6/7.5/9/10.5/12% for 6s. Max 4 stacks. Can only occur once every 0.5s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/whiteblind/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:54', '2026-06-05 11:50:54'),
('dcc10747-97c3-43ef-9c76-c59fa01a0eac', 'Fleuve Cendre Ferryman', 'Sword', '4', '42', 'Energy Recharge', 'Ironbone', 'Increases Elemental Skill CRIT Rate by 8%. Additionally, increases Energy Recharge by 16% for 5s after using an Elemental Skill.s', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/fleuve-cendre-ferryman/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:21', '2026-06-05 11:50:21'),
('dcf582d4-940a-4dd4-889c-76055b078941', 'Blackcliff Pole', 'Polearm', '4', '42', 'CRIT DMG', 'Press the Advantage', 'After defeating an enemy, ATK is increased by 12/15/18/21/24% for 30s. This effect has a maximum of 3 stacks, and the duration of each stack is independent of the others.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/blackcliff-pole/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:11', '2026-06-05 11:50:11'),
