('ef73b224-fcca-426c-8644-d1f78bba4bc1', 'The Viridescent Hunt', 'Bow', '4', '42', 'CRIT Rate', 'Verdant Wind', 'Upon hit, Normal and Aimed Shot Attacks have a 50% chance to generate a Cyclone, which will continuously attract surrounding enemies, dealing 40% of ATK as DMG to these enemies every 0.5s for 4s. This effect can only occur once every 14s.', 'https://genshin.jmp.blue/weapons/the-viridescent-hunt/icon.png', 1000.0000, 1000, '2026-06-05 11:50:49', '2026-06-05 11:50:49'),
